# pass the lines marked with a '#'
# they are made to be read from humans

# under :
# mtllib -> associated material file
# o -> object name
# v -> vertices (VBO)
# f -> vertex indices (EBO)
# s -> smooth shading (not done)
# usemtl [mat] -> use this material in mtllib

# I should triangulate quad face
mtllib rectangle.mtl
o Rectangle
v 0.5 0.5 0.0
v 0.5 -0.5 0.0
v -0.5 -0.5 0.0
v -0.5 0.5 0.0
f 1 2 3 4
